name: Process Embedded
type:
  blueId: 4ugZ87HaumAJezmgvi2QoqfEdqfwpviQavmak8C8ewF4
description: >
  Declares immediate owned managed-document occurrences within one authoritative
  managed document. Exact paths identify one occurrence each when present.
  Collection paths select the ordinary direct members of object-compatible
  collections when present. A semantically absent declared collection contributes
  zero current occurrences and does not cause the processor to synthesize a
  collection object. The feeder derives subscriptions transitively; the processor
  uses exact occurrence evidence and never scans unrelated branches. Embedding
  does not import parent contracts, does not traverse the reserved contracts
  field, and does not give wildcard or list-position semantics to collection paths.
paths:
  type:
    blueId: 85ip88snCGrgUNdi1rUFqqAxcxwVGKV2g4LjsKoyKmXK
  itemType:
    blueId: GX7CFUmSDrE2MzptunLCCdZwnuwwrenRQqEnHL4x3uoC
  description: >
    Optional normalized absolute Runtime Pointers, each identifying one immediate
    owned managed-document occurrence when present. A path may be absent only
    under the exact prospective-occurrence rules of Contracts 1.0.
  schema:
    uniqueItems: true
collectionPaths:
  type:
    blueId: 85ip88snCGrgUNdi1rUFqqAxcxwVGKV2g4LjsKoyKmXK
  itemType:
    blueId: GX7CFUmSDrE2MzptunLCCdZwnuwwrenRQqEnHL4x3uoC
  description: >
    Optional normalized absolute Runtime Pointers to object-compatible collections.
    When a collection is present, each ordinary direct member is one immediate
    owned managed-document occurrence. Proven absence means zero occurrences;
    incomplete evidence is not absence.
  schema:
    uniqueItems: true
